Subjugation score as the game computes it: base score = total damage / 100, a survival bonus
by deaths (+200% with none) and nine max-combo tiers (+20% at 6 up to +180% at 46+), ported from
JCalandre/lunar-tear (1f26f36, 8c197c1); our save already accumulated the waves. Stored high
scores are rescaled / 100 once.

